{"2805530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shattered Dreams: that one time when all my applications got rejected, so I started my own company. My life became an idle / clicker game where I must increase all incremental values and squeeze my employees for every last bit of soul they have left.", "steam_appid": 2805530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Welcome to <strong>Shattered Dreams</strong>,<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2ae79696758ac81af7922282083297e9.poster.avif?t=1725546693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2ae79696758ac81af7922282083297e9.webm?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2ae79696758ac81af7922282083297e9.mp4?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect Resources and Build Factories</strong><br>a world where every resource matters. Gather materials from forests, caves, and even the moon to build factories and enhance your capabilities. Aren't you tired of the classic idle game loop that optimizes the fun out of the experience? Well, I’m sorry to say that it’s here too, but it’s way less noticeable—trust me.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/8d3ae651cdf82cb0a68bd70b1b048cfe.poster.avif?t=1725546693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/8d3ae651cdf82cb0a68bd70b1b048cfe.webm?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/8d3ae651cdf82cb0a68bd70b1b048cfe.mp4?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight Off Monsters and Bosses</strong><br>Confront relentless goofy monsters with in-depth lore and epic bosses. Train in the gym to build your strength. From 2D platformers souls-like challenges to FPS arena bosses and secret missions to take down those pesky unions heck even arcade space shooter, Your entire lifetime of gaming skills will be tested.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2d1a7c11dbb44b29621fabd8255b6ca7.poster.avif?t=1725546693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2d1a7c11dbb44b29621fabd8255b6ca7.webm?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2d1a7c11dbb44b29621fabd8255b6ca7.mp4?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Tools and Expand Your Empire</strong><br>Craft tools to enhance your survival and efficiency. Each creation requires your skills to be put to the test—the better you perform, the better the tools will be. If you fail, just extract more effort from your employees to retry. and if they run dry, build a spaceship to exploit even more planets.<br><br>And if that doesn't convince you, maybe me begging will... please, man, buy this game. I need the money for rent, food, and my crippling caffeine addiction. Plus, my landlord says exposure bucks don't pay the bills. So, help a guy out—every purchase gets me one step closer to survival and sanity!<br><br>", "about_the_game": "Welcome to <strong>Shattered Dreams</strong>,<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2ae79696758ac81af7922282083297e9.poster.avif?t=1725546693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2ae79696758ac81af7922282083297e9.webm?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2ae79696758ac81af7922282083297e9.mp4?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect Resources and Build Factories</strong><br>a world where every resource matters. Gather materials from forests, caves, and even the moon to build factories and enhance your capabilities. Aren't you tired of the classic idle game loop that optimizes the fun out of the experience? Well, I’m sorry to say that it’s here too, but it’s way less noticeable—trust me.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/8d3ae651cdf82cb0a68bd70b1b048cfe.poster.avif?t=1725546693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/8d3ae651cdf82cb0a68bd70b1b048cfe.webm?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/8d3ae651cdf82cb0a68bd70b1b048cfe.mp4?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight Off Monsters and Bosses</strong><br>Confront relentless goofy monsters with in-depth lore and epic bosses. Train in the gym to build your strength. From 2D platformers souls-like challenges to FPS arena bosses and secret missions to take down those pesky unions heck even arcade space shooter, Your entire lifetime of gaming skills will be tested.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2d1a7c11dbb44b29621fabd8255b6ca7.poster.avif?t=1725546693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2d1a7c11dbb44b29621fabd8255b6ca7.webm?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/extras/2d1a7c11dbb44b29621fabd8255b6ca7.mp4?t=1725546693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Tools and Expand Your Empire</strong><br>Craft tools to enhance your survival and efficiency. Each creation requires your skills to be put to the test—the better you perform, the better the tools will be. If you fail, just extract more effort from your employees to retry. and if they run dry, build a spaceship to exploit even more planets.<br><br>And if that doesn't convince you, maybe me begging will... please, man, buy this game. I need the money for rent, food, and my crippling caffeine addiction. Plus, my landlord says exposure bucks don't pay the bills. So, help a guy out—every purchase gets me one step closer to survival and sanity!<br><br>", "short_description": "Do you hate your life? Well, boy, do I have the game for you! Follow the story of a social reject turned evil, soul-sucking CEO. Battle your inner demons, suppress workers' unions, and travel through space and beyond to increase your profit. But watch your step while getting off your ship.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Fun and thought-provoking game”<br>10/10 – Chat-GPT<br><br>“Great tool to humanize poor hard working CEO's”<br>10/10 – Jeffy B<br><br>“Could've been better”<br>2/10 – My impostor syndrome<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/header.jpg?t=1725546693", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1725546693", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1725546693", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I wuv u</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Rainy Parts"], "publishers": ["Rainy Parts"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1001922], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Shattered Dreams: that one time when all my applications got rejected, so I started my own company. My life became an idle / clicker game where I must increase all incremental values and squeeze my employees for every last bit of soul they have left.", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1001922, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Shattered Dreams - $4.99", "op